      "body": "﻿# RepoPulse v1.2.1 — Initial Public Release\n\nThe first public release of RepoPulse brings together a GitHub repository dashboard, REST API, and Model Context Protocol (MCP) server.\n\n## Features\n- Responsive GitHub repository dashboard\n- Repository statistics, languages, contributors, releases, and activity\n- REST API with normalized responses\n- Five-minute in-memory API caching\n- Basic rate limiting and security headers\n- MCP server with six GitHub repository tools\n- MCP Inspector compatibility\n- Developer documentation and setup examples\n\n## Verification\n- Automated tests passing\n- Production TypeScript and Vite build successful\n- MCP tools successfully tested through MCP Inspector\n\n## Getting Started\nSee README.md and the docs directory for installation, API usage, and MCP configuration.\n\nLicense: MIT\r\n"
